###  http://www.semanticweb.org/marco/ontologies/2025/0/untitled-ontology-16/haPrequel
:haPrequel rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
           rdfs:subPropertyOf owl:topObjectProperty ;
           owl:inverseOf :haSequel ;
           rdf:type owl:AsymmetricProperty ,
